%% Sequence diagram: request flow through the system
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant F as FastAPI
  participant S as Services
  participant A as Agent
  participant L as LLM
  participant T as Tools

  C->>F: POST /api/v1/chat
  F->>S: validate & map schema
  S->>A: execute/run
  A->>L: request generation
  A->>T: use tool (if needed)
  L-->>A: LLMResponse
  A-->>S: result
  S-->>F: response schema
  F-->>C: HTTP response
